    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2014_phy_a5.png\">\r\n\r\nBy absorption laws\r\n$$\r\nY=\\bar{A}+\\bar{A} \\cdot B\r\n$$\r\nor $\\quad Y=(\\bar{A} \\cdot B)+\\bar{A}=\\bar{A} \\cdot(B+1)=\\bar{A} \\cdot 1=\\bar{A}$",
